data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"### arbitrum@3::crates.wasm-testsuite.src.main::do_not_prove\n`arbitrum@3` · repo:4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba · as_of 2026-07-24T21:04:50Z\nhttps://github.com/OffchainLabs/nitro/blob/4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba/crates/wasm-testsuite/src/main.rs#L185-L221\n\n```\n// necessary, the funcs are comprised of opcodes better tested elsewhere and aren't worth\n// 10x the test time.\n    let mut do_not_prove = HashSet::new();\n```\n\n### arbitrum@3::crates.prover.src.kzg::ensure\n`arbitrum@3` · repo:4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba · as_of 2026-07-24T21:04:50Z\nhttps://github.com/OffchainLabs/nitro/blob/4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba/crates/prover/src/kzg.rs#L35-L72\n\n```\nensure!(\n        preimage.len() == BYTES_PER_BLOB,\n        \"Trying to KZG prove preimage of unexpected length {}\",\n```\n\n### 04bf307b-6b8b-5444-a202-539878a25157\n`arbitrum@3` · repo:4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba · as_of 2026-07-24T21:04:50Z\nhttps://github.com/OffchainLabs/nitro/blob/4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba/README.md#L35-L42\n\n```\nAbout Arbitrum Nitro\nThe last piece of the stack is a slimmed-down version of our ArbOS component, rewritten in Go, which provides the\nrest of what’s needed to run an L2 chain: things like cross-chain communication, and a new and improved batching\nand compression system to minimize L1…\n```\n\n### arbitrum@3::crates.prover.src.utils::hash_preimage\n`arbitrum@3` · repo:4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba · as_of 2026-07-24T21:04:50Z\nhttps://github.com/OffchainLabs/nitro/blob/4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba/crates/prover/src/utils.rs#L79-L102\n\n```\npub fn hash_preimage(preimage: &[u8], ty: PreimageType) -> Result<[u8; 32]> {\n    match ty {\n```\n\n### arbitrum@3::crates.prover.src.kzg::kzg_proof\n`arbitrum@3` · repo:4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba · as_of 2026-07-24T21:04:50Z\nhttps://github.com/OffchainLabs/nitro/blob/413