date with the latest ArbOS since only the…\n```\n\n### arbitrum@3::crates.caller-env.src.arbcrypto::ecrecover_core\n`arbitrum@3` · repo:4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba · as_of 2026-07-24T21:04:50Z\nhttps://github.com/OffchainLabs/nitro/blob/4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba/crates/caller-env/src/arbcrypto.rs#L26-L48\n\n```\nfn ecrecover_core(\n    hash: &[u8; HASH_LENGTH],\n    sig_with_id: &[u8; SIGNATURE_WITH_ID_LENGTH],\n```"}],"structuredContent":{"intent":"lookup","recipe":null,"hits":[{"selector":"arbitrum@3::crates.wasm-testsuite.src.main::do_not_prove","source_url":"https://github.com/OffchainLabs/nitro/blob/4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba/crates/wasm-testsuite/src/main.rs#L185-L221","snippet":"// necessary, the funcs are comprised of opcodes better tested elsewhere and aren't worth\n// 10x the test time.\n    let mut do_not_prove = HashSet::new();","project":"arbitrum","version":"3","version_defaulted":false,"last_validated":"2026-08-14T17:23:13Z","as_of":"2026-07-24T21:04:50Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba"},{"selector":"arbitrum@3::crates.prover.src.kzg::ensure","source_url":"https://github.com/OffchainLabs/nitro/blob/4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba/crates/prover/src/kzg.rs#L35-L72","snippet":"ensure!(\n        preimage.len() == BYTES_PER_BLOB,\n        \"Trying to KZG prove preimage of unexpected length {}\",","project":"arbitrum","version":"3","version_defaulted":false,"last_validated":"2026-08-14T17:23:13Z","as_of":"2026-07-24T21:04:50Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba"},{"selector":"04bf307b-6b8b-5444-a202-539878a25157","source_url":"https://github.com/OffchainLabs/nitro/blob/4130f4c50d81209ff94aa63b51ed55d3739cdaba/README.md#L35-L42","snippet":"About Arbitrum Nitro\nThe last piece of the stack is a slimmed-down version of our ArbOS component, rewritten in Go, which provides the\nrest of what’s needed to run an L2 chain: things